This licence covers the source code in this repository only.

The flight data the application displays at runtime is not covered by it, and
carries its own terms:

  * adsb.lol       — Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0. Attribution required.
                     https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/
  * airplanes.live — non-commercial use
  * adsb.fi        — community feed
  * adsbdb.com, hexdb.io, planespotters.net, open-meteo.com
                   — free, volunteer-run. Photographs remain the property of
                     their photographers and must carry the credit the API
                     returns.

None of these require an API key. All of them are run by volunteers and are
easy to overload — see docs/FREE-STACK.md before pointing anything at them at
scale.
